# 仓库内统一用 LF 存储，避免 Windows 的 autocrlf 在不同机器上产生幽灵 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# PowerShell 脚本必须带 CRLF，且**必须保留 UTF-8 BOM**
# （Windows PowerShell 5.1 没有 BOM 时会按 GBK 读取，中文注释会变成乱码并引发语法错误）
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.keystore binary
